    "detailed_description": "Solve challenging puzzles!  Jump over endless hazards!  Shoot lots of bad guys!  Maybe discover why everyone calls you lemon.  Korvae In Space is a fun mix between a puzzle-platformer and side-scrolling shooter.<br><br>Explore the world of Shennari.  A lot has changed while you were asleep.  What happened to your civilization?  Who are the new masters of this land?  Piece together the past as you fight for your life.<br><br><strong>Included in Korvae in space:</strong><br><br>Purchasing Korvae in space gets you all 5 exciting chapters.<br><br>Each of the 5 Chapters contains many puzzles, battles, and other challenges.  Different Chapters feature different scenery, unique challenges, and various characters.  Searching carefully within a Chapter may reveal clues about past events or future Chapters.",
